{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40693","headline":"秋宿梓州牛头寺 · 李洞","name":"秋宿梓州牛头寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月去檐三尺，川云入寺楼。\n灵山顿离衆，列宿不多稠。\n篆字焚初缺，翻经诵若流。\n窗闲二江冷，帘卷半空秋。\n诏散松梢别，棊终竹节收。\n静增双阙念，高并五翁游。\n鹤梦生红日，云闲锁梓州。\n望空工部眼，搔乱广文头。\n石室僧调马，银河客问牛。\n晓楼归下界，大地一浮沤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}